    <node id="ff30d124dedbbdced461517eb7cc9e181b5389e6c1047b55ed5e41f860ec5349">
      <data key="d0">The Riverside Bakery was founded in 1998 by Maria Chen in the town of Millbrook.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">571039edd1e2d888eda9c4140e2d1f1655f933c12d0372ba601c5ec8efbc6e38</data>
    </node>
    <node id="74edfe9456db53b5d60341b143bc7f4b40a4f3ab7e817f362b38242bcd1e3223">
      <data key="d0">In 2015, Maria's son, David Chen, took over as head baker.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">571039edd1e2d888eda9c4140e2d1f1655f933c12d0372ba601c5ec8efbc6e38</data>
    </node>
    <node id="a2fca71a264ff8ec9ede5c3e654db7cfb11b049acf6a61f89c19390c5cd72aff">
      <data key="d0">Maria's son, David Chen, took over as head baker in 2015.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">571039edd1e2d888eda9c4140e2d1f1655f933c12d0372ba601c5ec8efbc6e38</data>
    </node>
    <node id="1da8e712f904a352331786b877221e6af1ac15a1e373d22bc7ebfe983f994e7b">
      <data key="d0">The bakery supplies bread to three local restaurants: The Green Table, Millbrook Diner, and Oakview Cafe.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">571039edd1e2d888eda9c4140e2d1f1655f933c12d0372ba601c5ec8efbc6e38</data>
    </node>
    <node id="8ebffd0d18d8449adc1f5fa58f7411dc93dc7cfb2c0e64db9868ebde2e20d920">
      <data key="d0">The bakery is famous for its sourdough bread, which is baked fresh every morning.</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">571039edd1e2d888eda9c4140e2d1f1655f933c12d0372ba601c5ec8efbc6e38</data>
    </node>
    <node id="571039edd1e2d888eda9c4140e2d1f1655f933c12d0372ba601c5ec8efbc6e38">
      <data key="d2">571039edd1e2d888eda9c4140e2d1f1655f933c12d0372ba601c5ec8efbc6e38</data>
      <data key="d0">The Riverside Bakery was founded in 1998 by Maria Chen in the town of Millbrook. The bakery is famous for its sourdough bread, which is baked fresh every morning. In 2015, Maria's son, David Chen, took over as head baker. The bakery supplies bread to three local restaurants: The Green Table, Millbrook Diner, and Oakview Cafe.</data>
      <data key="d1">passage</data>
    </node>
